2026-09-10 18:47:18,724 | INFO | rag.vectorstore | QDRANT POINT: id=633ca9cc51e8402ba22c281924e23f6b payload={'text': "Acme Corporation\n Engineering — Production Incident Response Runbook\n Document ID: ACME-ENG-RB-021  |  Version: 4.0  |  Effective Date: February 1, 2026  |  Classification: Internal Use\n Only\n1. Purpose\nThis runbook defines how the Engineering on-call rotation detects, triages, escalates, and resolves\nproduction incidents affecting Acme's customer-facing services. It complements but does not replace the\nInformation Security Incident Reporting process defined in the IT Security Policy (ACME-POL-IT-014) for\nincidents with a security or data-exposure component.\n2. Severity Levels and Response Targets\nProduction incidents are classified SEV1 through SEV4. Response and mitigation targets below apply to\nengineering on-call response, which is distinct from the Security Operations Center's security incident\nresponse times.\nSeverity\nDefinition\nAck Target\nMitigation Target\nSEV1\nFull outage or data loss risk, all customers affected\n5 minutes\n30 minutes\nSEV2", 'metadata': {'producer': 'ReportLab PDF Library - (opensource)', 'creator': '(unspecified)', 'creationdate': '2026-08-24T09:44:48+00:00', 'author': '(anonymous)', 'keywords': '', 'moddate': '2026-08-24T09:44:48+00:00', 'subject': '(unspecified)', 'title': '(anonymous)', 'trapped': '/False', 'source': 'Acme_Corp_Engineering_Incident_Runbook.pdf', 'total_pages': 3, 'page': 0, 'page_label': '1', 'file_path': 'corpora\\Acme_Corp_Engineering_Incident_Runbook.pdf', 'file_type': '.pdf', 'source_type': 'unknown', 'ingestion_time': '2026-09-10T13:17:18.549536+00:00', 'content_length': 1914, 'word_count': 268, 'document_id': '537d20a6ebb2d677', 'chunk_id': '537d20a6ebb2d677_chunk_1', 'chunk_index': 1}}
2026-09-10 18:47:18,725 | INFO | rag.vectorstore | QDRANT POINT: id=5e6f07832a7d4d718874823ab18262e5 payload={'text': 'response times.\nSeverity\nDefinition\nAck Target\nMitigation Target\nSEV1\nFull outage or data loss risk, all customers affected\n5 minutes\n30 minutes\nSEV2\nMajor feature unavailable, subset of customers affected\n15 minutes\n2 hours\nSEV3\nDegraded performance, workaround available\n1 hour\n1 business day\nSEV4\nMinor/cosmetic issue, no customer impact\n1 business day\nNext sprint\n3. On-Call Escalation Path\n\x7f Primary on-call engineer is paged automatically via PagerDuty when an alert fires or a SEV1/SEV2 is\nmanually declared in #incidents.\n\x7f If unacknowledged within the target window, PagerDuty auto-escalates to the secondary on-call\nengineer.\n\x7f For SEV1 incidents, the Incident Commander role is activated automatically and a dedicated Zoom\nbridge and #incident- Slack channel are created.\n\x7f If the incident involves suspected unauthorized access, data exfiltration, or a security control failure,\nthe on-call engineer must also notify the Security Operations Center (SOC) immediately per the IT', 'metadata': {'producer': 'ReportLab PDF Library - (opensource)', 'creator': '(unspecified)', 'creationdate': '2026-08-24T09:44:48+00:00', 'author': '(anonymous)', 'keywords': '', 'moddate': '2026-08-24T09:44:48+00:00', 'subject': '(unspecified)', 'title': '(anonymous)', 'trapped': '/False', 'source': 'Acme_Corp_Engineering_Incident_Runbook.pdf', 'total_pages': 3, 'page': 0, 'page_label': '1', 'file_path': 'corpora\\Acme_Corp_Engineering_Incident_Runbook.pdf', 'file_type': '.pdf', 'source_type': 'unknown', 'ingestion_time': '2026-09-10T13:17:18.549536+00:00', 'content_length': 1914, 'word_count': 268, 'document_id': '537d20a6ebb2d677', 'chunk_id': '537d20a6ebb2d677_chunk_2', 'chunk_index': 2}}
2026-09-10 18:47:18,725 | INFO | rag.vectorstore | QDRANT POINT: id=e483755debdb4b88baebe819b91db28d payload={'text': 'the on-call engineer must also notify the Security Operations Center (SOC) immediately per the IT\nSecurity Policy — this triggers the separate, higher-priority security response track.\n4. Roles During an Incident', 'metadata': {'producer': 'ReportLab PDF Library - (opensource)', 'creator': '(unspecified)', 'creationdate': '2026-08-24T09:44:48+00:00', 'author': '(anonymous)', 'keywords': '', 'moddate': '2026-08-24T09:44:48+00:00', 'subject': '(unspecified)', 'title': '(anonymous)', 'trapped': '/False', 'source': 'Acme_Corp_Engineering_Incident_Runbook.pdf', 'total_pages': 3, 'page': 0, 'page_label': '1', 'file_path': 'corpora\\Acme_Corp_Engineering_Incident_Runbook.pdf', 'file_type': '.pdf', 'source_type': 'unknown', 'ingestion_time': '2026-09-10T13:17:18.549536+00:00', 'content_length': 1914, 'word_count': 268, 'document_id': '537d20a6ebb2d677', 'chunk_id': '537d20a6ebb2d677_chunk_3', 'chunk_index': 3}}
